      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To emphasize the moral imperative of progressive change, focus the \"Progressive Perspective\" on the **unintended and biased *outcomes*** of the system, not just the *rules on the surface level*.\n\nFor an engaging activity, use a \"Bias in the System\" sort of scenario, like biased hiring in a local, make-believe company, and ask the class to debate the **right to an outcome** (fair treatment for all) versus **adhering to the established, biased process $\\",
